esis.26.3\">Gn 26:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:4\" href=\"/Genesis.26.4\">4</a> (J<sup>R</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:54\" href=\"/Genesis.41.54\">41:54</a> (JE); it denotes <em>lands, countries</em>, often in contrast to Canaan, <em>lands of the nations</em>, etc., v. especially abs. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:32\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.32\">Ez 20:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.4\">22:4</a>; = the various petty divisions of Canaan afterward united under Israel’s control <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:3\" href=\"/Genesis.26.3\">Gn 26:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:4\" href=\"/Genesis.26.4\">4</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.2\">1 Ch 13:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְצוֹת יִשְׂרָאֵל</span>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.23\">2 Ch 11:23</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְצוֹת יְהוּדָה</span>."}],"num":"5."}]},"rid":"BDB00868","strong_numbers":["776"],"next_hw":"אַרְצָא","prev_hw":"אַרְפַּכְשַׁד","root":true,"occurrences":"2407","quotes":[],"GK":["824"],"TWOT":["167"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}